        <panel label="Touch" name="gtab_touch" layout="topleft" follows="all" height="470" width="586">
            <text text_color="0.95 0.92 0.84 1" follows="left|top" height="16" layout="topleft" left="4" name="t_lbl" top="6" width="578">When someone clicks it (empty: its shop, else its quests, else nothing)</text>
            <line_editor follows="left|top" height="22" layout="topleft" left="4" max_length_chars="600" name="t_do" top="24" width="578" label="actions, separated by ; e.g. dialog:intro   or   say:Hello!; handout:Welcome card" />
            <text text_color="0.95 0.92 0.84 1" follows="left|top" height="16" layout="topleft" left="4" name="t_faction_lbl" top="57" width="70">Faction</text>
            <line_editor follows="left|top" height="22" layout="topleft" left="78" max_length_chars="24" name="t_faction" top="54" width="200" label="e.g. moonfang"
             tool_tip="NPCs with the same faction share what players have earned with it (a-z, 0-9, _ -)" />
            <text follows="left|top" height="16" layout="topleft" left="286" name="t_faction_note" top="57" width="296" text_color="0.80 0.82 0.86 1">Same faction: they share players' opinions.</text>
            <text text_color="0.95 0.92 0.84 1" follows="left|top" height="16" layout="topleft" left="4" name="t_hand_lbl" top="89" width="120">Hand out an item</text>
            <line_editor follows="left|top" height="22" layout="topleft" left="128" max_length_chars="63" name="t_hand_name" top="86" width="300" label="its name in the NPC's contents" />
            <button image_color="0 0 0 0" image_color_disabled="0 0 0 0" hover_glow_amount="0" label_shadow="false" label_color="0.95 0.92 0.84 1" label_color_selected="0.95 0.92 0.84 1" label_color_disabled="0.62 0.62 0.66 1" label_color_disabled_selected="0.62 0.62 0.66 1" follows="left|top" height="22" label="Add to touch" layout="topleft" left="432" name="t_hand_add" top="86" width="150" />
            <text follows="left|top" height="40" layout="topleft" left="4" name="t_hand_note" top="112" width="578" word_wrap="true" text_color="0.80 0.82 0.86 1">Put a notecard, texture or landmark in the NPC's contents (its root prim), then use handout:its name in any action. The same item goes to the same person at most once in 10 minutes. It works for everyone, not only players.</text>
            <text follows="left|top" height="236" layout="topleft" left="4" name="t_help" top="156" width="578" word_wrap="true" text_color="0.80 0.82 0.86 1">Actions (separate with ;): say:text, anim:name, loop:name, stop:name, sound:name, face, follow, approach, flee, ai:instruction, intent:roam, goto:place, dialog:id, quest:id, accept:id, advance:id, drop:id, shop, handout:name, event:id, endevent:id, close.
Game players only: flag:name, unflag:name, rep:me:+5 (or a faction), give:item:1, xp:50, money:+10. Only a player's own dialogue choice or a shop may take from them (take:item:1, money:-5).
Who words for conditions: player, notplayer, owner, friend, stranger, flag:name, rep:me&gt;=50, quest:id, done:id, with not: in front to turn them round.</text>
